  "contract": "Mercenary for Hire! and High-Risk are open-world states; inside an arena the arena team decides who can fight. A Human High-Risk Mercenary who enters a War Games Nagrand Arena match against a Human PvE rival keeps Mercenary for Hire! through the arena's aura cleanup, but it has no effect there: the server gives them their Human faction, and the two are on opposite teams and can attack each other. High-Risk turns itself off and is remembered, and Mercenary for Hire! cannot be cast inside. Back outside, High-Risk returns and the player is a Mercenary and an Outlaw again.",
